        "action": "Fund & make mandatory solar panels in every large single level car park",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Fund solar panels to roof existing large single-level car parks and make it mandatory for developers to install them on new car parks of that type.  We believe this would benefit achieving net zero while also stopping cars from getting too hot.",
